      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Ad Segments",
      "Anchor": "ad-segments",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "An Ad segment is a collection of entities (such as members or companies) to which ads can be targeted. Ad Segments are created automatically after DMP Segments are matched with LinkedIn members.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Permissions",
      "Anchor": "permissions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Permissions"
      ],
      "Text": "There are two conditions for successful requests:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Permissions",
      "Anchor": "permissions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Permissions"
      ],
      "Text": "Scope permission accessibility for:\n\nrw_ads (read/write)\nr_ads (read-only)\n\n\nThe authenticated Ad Account user that provides consent has one of the following roles on the Ad Account:\n\nACCOUNT_BILLING_ADMIN\nACCOUNT_MANAGER\nCAMPAIGN_MANAGER\nCREATIVE_MANAGER\nVIEWER (read-only, even with rw_ads scope)",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
