          {
            "Text": "A \u0027retargeting\u0027 segment is used to target the visitors to all or part of an advertiser\u0027s website. This type of segment is populated based on the rules defined in an adPageSet. It can be used in the \u0027dynamic\u0027 targeting facet of an ad campaign.",
